Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.91,0:00:22.02,OP-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}さらば　地球よ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.55,0:00:25.84,OP-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}旅立つ船は
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.21,0:00:35.64,OP-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}宇宙戦艦「ヤマト」
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.97,0:00:39.49,OP-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}宇宙の彼方　イスカンダルへ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.58,0:00:44.35,OP-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}運命　背負い　今とび立つ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.60,0:00:51.78,OP-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}必ずここへ　帰って来ると
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.95,0:01:00.87,OP-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}手をふる　人に　笑顔で答え
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.58,0:01:05.21,OP-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}銀河をはなれ　イスカンダルへ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.21,0:01:08.63,OP-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}はるばるのぞむ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.63,0:01:16.13,OP-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}宇宙戦艦「ヤマト」
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.91,0:00:22.02,OP-CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}再见了  地球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.55,0:00:25.84,OP-CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}出航的舰船
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.21,0:00:35.64,OP-CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}宇宙战舰  大和号
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.97,0:00:39.49,OP-CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}向着宇宙的彼方伊斯坎达尔前进
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.58,0:00:44.35,OP-CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}背负着使命 即刻启程
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.60,0:00:51.78,OP-CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}一定会再次回到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.95,0:01:00.87,OP-CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}挥着手  用微笑回答别人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.58,0:01:05.21,OP-CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}离开银河向着伊斯坎达尔前进
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.21,0:01:08.63,OP-CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}不远万里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.63,0:01:16.13,OP-CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}宇宙战舰  大和号
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:02.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.63,0:25:25.70,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,遠ざかる 星の 彼方を さすらう魂よ
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.81,0:25:27.61,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,聞えるか
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.63,0:25:39.96,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,永遠に 続く この銀河で 安らかに眠れ
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.52,0:25:44.07,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,別離のレクイエム
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.09,0:25:49.81,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,君へのレクイエム Sing along
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.30,0:25:58.44,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,讃える歌声 忘れ得ぬメモリー
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.46,0:26:03.29,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,And we’ll never forget your name
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.55,0:26:05.96,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.96,0:26:12.84,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,さらば友よ 今は悲しみ 尽きないけど
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.13,0:26:20.40,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,またいつか この星の海で きっと
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.42,0:26:23.98,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,Pray for the earth　その誓いを
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.99,0:26:27.59,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,Pray for the dream　その理想を
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.61,0:26:36.61,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh Oh Oh Oh yeah last forever
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.63,0:25:25.70,ED-CN,NTP,0,0,0,,漂流于遥远的星球彼岸的灵魂啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.81,0:25:27.61,ED-CN,NTP,0,0,0,,听得到吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.63,0:25:39.96,ED-CN,NTP,0,0,0,,请在这无垠的银河中 安息长眠吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.52,0:25:44.07,ED-CN,NTP,0,0,0,,分别的安魂曲
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.09,0:25:49.81,ED-CN,NTP,0,0,0,,送给你的安魂曲 Sing along
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.30,0:25:58.44,ED-CN,NTP,0,0,0,,用赞美的旋律 歌颂难忘的记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.46,0:26:03.29,ED-CN,NTP,0,0,0,,And we’ll never forget your name
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.55,0:26:05.96,ED-CN,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,ED-CN,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.96,0:26:12.84,ED-CN,NTP,0,0,0,,别了挚友 虽然我现在悲痛万分
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.13,0:26:20.40,ED-CN,NTP,0,0,0,,总有一天 定会在这片星海中重逢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,ED-CN,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.42,0:26:23.98,ED-CN,NTP,0,0,0,,Pray for the earth　以这誓言
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.99,0:26:27.59,ED-CN,NTP,0,0,0,,Pray for the dream　用这理想
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.61,0:26:36.61,ED-CN,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh Oh Oh Oh yeah last forever
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,ED-CN,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,ED-CN,NTP,0,0,0,,
